{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows经注册表疑似远程读取凭据。对应需求：凭据访问。官方：Potential Remote Credential Access via Registry。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.file-*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows经注册表疑似远程读取凭据","references":["https://github.com/fortra/impacket/blob/master/examples/secretsdump.py","https://www.elastic.co/security-labs/detect-credential-access"],"risk_score":73,"rule_id":"850d901a-2a3c-46c6-8b22-55398a01aad8","severity":"high","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 凭据访问","来源: 默认","对应需求: 凭据访问"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"file where host.os.type == \"windows\" and\n  event.action == \"creation\" and process.name : \"svchost.exe\" and\n  file.Ext.header_bytes : \"72656766*\" and user.id : (\"S-1-5-21-*\", \"S-1-12-1-*\") and file.size >= 30000 and\n  file.path : (\"?:\\\\Windows\\\\system32\\\\*.tmp\", \"?:\\\\WINDOWS\\\\Temp\\\\*.tmp\")\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows经注册表疑似远程读取凭据\n\n### 为何重要\n窃取或中继域与本机凭据\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程、用户与事件ID。\n2. 核对路径、注册表、外连地址与是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与凭据操作。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件与账号。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","winlog.event_data.TargetUserName","message"]},"threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1003","name":"OS Credential Dumping","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1003/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1003.002","name":"Security Account Manager","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1003/002/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0006","name":"Credential Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0006/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1021","name":"Remote Services","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1021/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0008","name":"Lateral Movement","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0008/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"}],"version":115,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
